<title>CHILE: Chile's Santa Isabel 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Chile's Santa Isabel 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean supermarket chain Santa Isabel SA reported the following results last year.</p>
<p>					1996	     1995</p>
<p>Net earnings		     10.31	     7.25</p>
<p>Operating profit		 10.04	     6.72</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	    1.29	     1.19</p>
<p>Total sales		     176.83	   141.43</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in millions of pesos.</p>
<p>(( --Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595X212))</p>
</text>
